    "content": "<div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，今日为师传你 <b>《烃衍化神录》</b>，此篇属于<b>选必3·第二章 有机官能团</b>，乃丹鼎峰核心心法。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🌟 一、引道·核心要义</h3><p>醇、酚、醛、酸、酯的性质和相互转化。</p><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">师姐，化学这一篇要注意什么？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">最要害的是——<b>醇 R-OH（消去/取代/氧化）</b>。这一句吃透，本章过半。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">📖 二、拆经·五大要点</h3><ul style=\"padding-left:20px;line-height:1.9\"><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 醇 R-OH（消去/取代/氧化）</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 酚 Ar-OH 弱酸性</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 醛 R-CHO 被氧化成酸</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 酸 R-COOH 酯化</li><li style=\"margin:6px 0\">✨ 酯 R-COOR' 水解</li></ul><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎨 三、图解·关键公式</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f8,#ffe6f0);border:1px dashed #d45a95;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#7a2050\"><b>📜 酯化 RCOOH+R'OH⇌RCOOR'+H₂O</b></div><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f8,#ffe6f0);border:1px dashed #d45a95;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#7a2050\"><b>📜 催化剂浓H₂SO₄, 加热</b></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🔥 四、演道·经典例题</h3><p>乙醇+乙酸→乙酸乙酯+水（酯化）</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">💬 五、对话·师徒印证</h3><div class=\"dlg-shixiong\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#4a7fc822,#4a7fc811);border-left:4px solid #4a7fc8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#4a7fc8\">⚔️ 大师兄：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">化学最爱在<b>酯 R-COOR' 水解</b>这里设坑。做题时先判物质、再看条件、后写方程。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shimei\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f4a3c822,#f4a3c811);border-left:4px solid #f4a3c8;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#f4a3c8\">🎀 师妹：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">我总是记不住方程式，怎么办？</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shijie\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#c67ecb22,#c67ecb11);border-left:4px solid #c67ecb;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#c67ecb\">🌸 师姐：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">方程式不是死记的，要理解<b>反应类型</b>——氧化还原、离子反应、酸碱中和。看到反应物就能推产物。</span></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">再补一句：<b>先配价态、再配质量守恒、最后核对电荷</b>——这是化学方程式配平的心法。</span></div><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🎯 六、印证·真题范式</h3><p>本章高考真题主要考察 <b>醇 R-OH（消去/取代/氧化）</b> 与 <b>酚 Ar-OH 弱酸性</b>。<br>解题三步：<br>① 读题识物质 → ② 判反应类型 → ③ 写方程/计算。</p><h3 style=\"margin:20px 0 10px;padding:8px 14px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#c67ecb33,transparent);border-left:5px solid #c67ecb;color:#5a3a5e;font-weight:700;border-radius:6px\">🧘 七、参悟·记忆口诀</h3><div style=\"margin:10px 0;padding:14px 18px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fff0f8,#ffe6f0);border:1px dashed #d45a95;border-radius:10px;font-family:'KaiTi',serif;text-align:center;color:#7a2050\"><b>📜 烃的衍生物要牢记，酯化 RCOOH+R'OH⇌RCOOR'+H₂O；识物、识反应、识守恒，化学考试无难题！</b></div><div class=\"dlg-shifu\" style=\"margin:12px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#8b6f4722,#8b6f4711);border-left:4px solid #8b6f47;border-radius:10px\"><b style=\"color:#8b6f47\">🧙‍♂️ 师傅：</b><span style=\"color:#333\">徒儿，此篇秘籍需反复参悟——化学重在\"变化\"二字！</span></div>",
